text = "Welcome to the Shop! Select a department below:

• /shop rods      - Upgrade your rod for higher catch & treasure
• /shop bait      - Purchase specialty baits & magnetic lures
• /shop upgrades  - Permanent character progression perks
• /shop boats     - Commission vessels with stacking -CD & +Fish
• /shop boosts    - Deploy automated net worker expeditions
• /shop special   - Exotic fish trade & legendary blessings
• /shop league    - High-tier enhancements purchased with hooks"

